  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2250\">\n<p data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2250\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2123\">Mutation Detected:</strong> Consistent with <strong data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2179\">myeloproliferative neoplasms (MPNs)</strong>, especially <strong data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2218\">Polycythemia Vera (PV)</strong> in JAK2 V617F-negative cases.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2348\">\n<p data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2348\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2278\">No Mutation Detected:</strong> Does not rule out all causes of MPN; clinical correlation required.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\" data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2472\">\n<p data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2472\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Should be interpreted along with <strong data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2405\">clinical features</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2414\">CBC</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2438\">bone marrow biopsy</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2471\">other molecular markers</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
